      "message": "This isn\u0027t the right way to fix this problem.  We shouldn\u0027t be decrementing duration within the loop at all because the timing will drift.\n\nInstead we should have:\n\nlong bedtime \u003d SystemClock.uptimeMillis() + duration;\ndo {\n    try {\n        this.wait(duration);\n    } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n    }\n    duration \u003d bedtime - SystemClock.uptimeMillis();\n} while (duration \u003e 0);",
